<title>FINLAND: OKOBANK NAMES NEW FUND MANAGER.</title>
<headline>OKOBANK NAMES NEW FUND MANAGER.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banking group OKOBANK said on Wednesday it had appointed Harri Nummela managing director of its mutual fund arm OP-Rahastoyhtio Oy as of March 1.</p>
<p>Nummela, 28, will succeed Hannu Ruotsalainen who was named investment manager at the banking group's life-insurance unit Henkivakuutusyhtio Aurum, OKOBANK said in a statement.</p>
<p>OP-Rahastoyhtio Oy administers funds worth 904 million markka at end-January, it said.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom +358-680 50 235</p>
